^{:go/end 375} (go/func loadTzinfoFromDirOrZip "loadTzinfoFromDirOrZip returns the contents of the file with the given name\nin dir. dir can either be an uncompressed zip file, or a directory.\n" [^string dir ^string name] :results [(slice byte) error]
